# DogeOS Chikyū (chain 6281971) — Coolify env skeleton
# Modeled on docs/build_plans/coolify-env/app.memewar.zone.env Robinhood 4663 block (lines 25–45).
# Addresses stay empty until a Chikyū deploy. Do not copy Robinhood/BNB addresses here.
# App service: VITE_* baked at build — redeploy after saving.
# API / indexer: same names without VITE_ where those services already do that for 56/4663.

# --- opt-in (staging first; production only with founder go) ---
# VITE_ALLOWED_CHAIN_IDS=...,6281971

# --- public RPC (app) ---
VITE_PUBLIC_RPC_6281971=https://rpc.testnet.dogeos.com
# Optional partner RPC later: Unifra / dRPC / Ankr. Public URL is the emergency fallback.

# --- SDK (app) ---
# Issued by Sira. Public. Origins must be registered (scheme+host+port).
VITE_DOGEOS_CLIENT_ID=
# Optional: VITE_DOGEOS_CLIENT_ID_STAGING=  VITE_DOGEOS_CLIENT_ID_PRODUCTION=

# --- indexer / API RPC ---
DOGEOS_RPC_HTTP_6281971=https://rpc.testnet.dogeos.com
# DOGEOS_RPC_WS_6281971=wss://ws.rpc.testnet.dogeos.com
# DOGEOS_TESTNET_RPC_URL=https://rpc.testnet.dogeos.com

# --- launchpad (fill after deploy; names match 4663) ---
